Koreatown meets Westwood. The D Line extension opened on Friday adding three new subway stations to the LA Metro system at La Brea Fairfax and La Cienega.

@metrolosangeles adds nearly four miles to the rail network with construction that stretched over a decade. The extension is the first phase with further expansions heading into Century City and Westwood by next year according to Metro.

📸: @dania_maxwell @marinagpena

