@angryyuca spent the Argentina Egypt match at @mercadobuenosairesusa where Egypt shocked the world and Argentina pulled off one of the most stunning comebacks in World Cup history. But most importantly he ate some great empanadas. 

Don’t forget to vote in Mesoamerica Madness our online tournament to decide LA’s best Latin American dish. Empanadas are in the final four against pupusas. You can vote at thelalocal.org/meso. 

